From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:38:44 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: Add SmartSens SC820CS image sensor driver

Add a V4L2 subdevice driver for the SmartSens SC820CS. The driver
brings the sensor up from its I/O, core and analogue supplies, the reset
line and 19.2 MHz MCLK, checks the chip ID and streams one 3264x2448
RAW10 mode at 30 fps over four CSI-2 lanes. Exposure, analogue gain and
vertical blanking are controls; orientation and rotation come from the
firmware node.

Signed-off-by: seilent <github@seilent.net>
---
